  "documents": [
    {
      "schemaVersion": "0.7",
      "documentId": "openrouter-bookshop-c1-s1",
      "title": "旧书店的异本",
      "summary": "对无结局书的争论",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c1-s1-start",
          "type": "cue",
          "cue": {
            "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c1-s1-bg",
            "type": "courtroom.background",
            "params": {
              "resource": {
                "packId": "official.courtroom-demo",
                "id": "background/office"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c1-s1-0",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你看看这本书，居然连结局都没有。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c1-s1-1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "可能是出版错误，也许是故意的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c1-s1-2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "可这故事开头那么完整，怎么可能有意留下空白。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c1-s1-3",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "也许是留给读者自己续写的机会。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c1-s1-4",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "听起来很荒谬，谁会花钱买一本没写完的东西？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c1-s1-5",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那就证明它不普通，旧书店应该珍藏它。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c1-s1-6",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "好吧，我相信你，这本书比任何传奇都要精彩。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "schemaVersion": "0.7",
      "documentId": "openrouter-bookshop-c2-s1",
      "title": "续写瞬间",
      "summary": "两人决定完成这个未了的故事。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c2-s1-start",
          "type": "cue",
          "cue": {
            "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c2-s1-bg",
            "type": "courtroom.background",
            "params": {
              "resource": {
                "packId": "official.courtroom-demo",
                "id": "background/lobby"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c2-s1-0",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "看，这页是 blank 的，好像是在等我们写点东西。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c2-s1-1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "原来作者是故意留个位置让我们继续。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c2-s1-2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我们可以写个 happy ending，完成这个故事。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c2-s1-3",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "但我们不知道故事主角是谁，该怎么写？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c2-s1-4",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "可以是那个女孩，青禾，把自己代入进去。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c2-s1-5",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "好，那我写她在书店发现秘密后，带着空白页离开。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-bookshop-c2-s1-6",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我们一起完成这个结局吧，这本书才不是无结局。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
